<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
  <title>Edugates Math-Science Team | Logic & Discrete Math</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --primary: #1e3a8a;
      --accent: #f59e0b;
      --bg: #0f172a;
      --card-bg: #1e293b;
      --text: #f8fafc;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; touch-action: manipulation; }
    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 20px 15px;
    }
    header {
      text-align: center;
      max-width: 800px;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }
    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #000;
      font-weight: 800;
      padding: 6px 16px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: #ffffff;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    p {
      color: #94a3b8;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }
    .fullscreen-btn {
      margin-top: 15px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
      color: white;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 1000px;
    }
    .card {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border: 2px solid #334155;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 20px;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: white;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      min-height: 140px;
      transition: transform 0.15s, border-color 0.15s;
    }
    .card:active, .card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      border-color: var(--accent);
      background: #273549;
    }
    .card h3 {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      color: #38bdf8;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .card p {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: #cbd5e1;
    }
    .math-tag {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--accent);
      margin-top: 12px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    footer {
      margin-top: auto;
      padding-top: 30px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: #64748b;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <div class="badge">Edugates Math-Science Team</div>
    <h1>Smartboard Logic Lab</h1>
    <p>Discrete mathematics, topology, and spatial reasoning puzzles</p>
    <button class="fullscreen-btn" onclick="toggleFullScreen()">⛶ Toggle Fullscreen (For Board)</button>
  </header>

  <main class="grid">
    <a href="bridges.html" class="card">
      <div>
        <h3>🌉 Bridges (Hashi)</h3>
        <p>Connect islands using degree invariants and Euler paths.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="math-tag">Graph Theory</div>
    </a>

    <a href="towers.html" class="card">
      <div>
        <h3>🏙️ Towers (Skyscrapers)</h3>
        <p>Determine skyscraper heights from perspective sightlines.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="math-tag">Latin Squares & Spatial Logic</div>
    </a>

    <a href="lightup.html" class="card">
      <div>
        <h3>💡 Light Up (Akari)</h3>
        <p>Place light emitters to illuminate every grid ray without conflict.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="math-tag">Ray-Casting & Coordinate Geometry</div>
    </a>

    <a href="slant.html" class="card">
      <div>
        <h3>📐 Slant (Gokigen)</h3>
        <p>Draw diagonal line segments avoiding cycles and loops.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="math-tag">Combinatorics & Trees</div>
    </a>

    <a href="net.html" class="card">
      <div>
        <h3>⚡ Net (Network)</h3>
        <p>Rotate tiles to link every single terminal to the central source.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="math-tag">Spanning Trees & Networks</div>
    </a>

    <a href="slither.html" class="card">
      <div>
        <h3>➰ Slitherlink</h3>
        <p>Connect grid dots into a single continuous closed loop.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="math-tag">Jordan Curve Theorem</div>
    </a>
  </main>

  <footer>
    Edugates Math-Science Team • Optimized for Touch Displays
  </footer>

  <script>
    function toggleFullScreen() {
      if (!document.fullscreenElement) {
        document.documentElement.requestFullscreen().catch(err => alert(err.message));
      } else {
        document.exitFullscreen();
      }
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
